\midrule
Uncorrected & 0.012 & 0.038 & 0.038 \\
Global-corrected & 0.094 & 0.021 & 0.094 \\
EC-HTE (oracle $\mathbf{C}_g$) & 0.003 & 0.005 & 0.005 \\
